Package: Rw
Title: Segmented Regression and Seasonal Adjustment Utilities
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuyan", "Peng", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pengyuyan1234567@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Fast piecewise regression with one or several break points
    (constant slope, segment specific intercepts), together with a simple
    climatology based de-seasonalisation helper. The regression routines are
    built on 'stats' internals and are meant to be called many times inside
    a search over candidate break points.
